-- 3ה: placed on the principals' academic table at level 5: ₪20,359.87,
-- grade ג+, which is at or above A.
@ref akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p2 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p3
`the principal example's placed salary` MEANS 20359.87

#ASSERT `the principal example's placed salary` AT LEAST `the principal example's A`

-- 3ה ¶4-15: for the part of the position above 100% and up to 150%, a
-- personal supplement: T is the March salary at the whole position, B is T
-- times the coefficient, C = B − the new table salary, turned into a
-- percentage of the combined salary.
@ref akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p4 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p5 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p6 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p7 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p8 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p9 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p10 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p11 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p12 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p13 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p14 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p15
GIVEN t IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER, `new table salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the personal supplement in shekels` t y `new table salary` IS
    `to the agora` (`the salary after conversion` t y) MINUS `new table salary`

GIVEN c IS A NUMBER, `combined salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the personal supplement as a percentage` c `combined salary` IS
    c DIVIDED BY `combined salary`

-- The example's steps 1-3 (step 4, the percentage, is cut off in the
-- corpus: see the hand-off).
@ref akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p16 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_1 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_2 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_3 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_4
`the principal example's T` MEANS 16314.81 PLUS 6230.46

