#ASSERT `to the agora` (`the salary after conversion` `the principal example's T` `the principal's coefficient`) EQUALS 25927.06
#ASSERT `the personal supplement in shekels` `the principal example's T` `the principal's coefficient` `the principal example's placed salary` EQUALS 5567.19

-- Examples of the rules above.
`an existing certified academic at 40%` MEANS
    `Ofek teacher` WITH
        `years of recognised actual teaching`        IS 8
        `years of seniority`                         IS 10
        `academic`                                   IS TRUE
        `certified to teach`                         IS TRUE
        `position fraction`                          IS 0.4
        `school joined Ofek Hadash`                  IS TRUE
        `signed the commitment to complete a degree` IS FALSE
        `approved by the exceptions committee`       IS FALSE
        `an intern`                                  IS FALSE
        `a health or arts-therapy professional`      IS FALSE

`an existing non-academic with 20 years who has not signed` MEANS
    `Ofek teacher` 20 20 FALSE TRUE 0.8 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE

`an existing non-academic with 29 years` MEANS
    `Ofek teacher` 29 29 FALSE TRUE 0.8 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE

`a new academic without a certificate` MEANS
    `Ofek teacher` 0 0 TRUE FALSE 1 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE

#ASSERT `joins Ofek Hadash` `an existing certified academic at 40%`
#ASSERT NOT `joins Ofek Hadash` `an existing non-academic with 20 years who has not signed`
#ASSERT `joins Ofek Hadash` `an existing non-academic with 29 years`
#ASSERT NOT `joins Ofek Hadash` `a new academic without a certificate`
#ASSERT `the part-time week` `the secondary teacher's week` 0.5 EQUALS `work week` 18 11.5 2 4.5
#ASSERT `frontal hours off for age` (`age-hours teacher` 55 TRUE) 1 EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `frontal hours at level` `the principal's frontal hours by complexity` 5 EQUALS 8
#ASSERT `the Ofek Hadash advance` `secondary or grades 7 and up, not a principal or first deputy` 5000 EQUALS 1350
#ASSERT `a counsellor's minimum frontal teaching hours` 1 EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `a counsellor's minimum frontal teaching hours` 0.5 EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `the reduction after maternity leave` 0.85 1 EQUALS "the mother's reduction"
#ASSERT `the working day starts at` (7 TIMES 60 PLUS 30) EQUALS 465

#TRACE `submitting the commitment to join` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `submit the commitment to join Ofek Hadash through the portal` AT 10
#TRACE `submitting the commitment to join` AT 0 WITH
